    <item>
      <title>Litigation Kiosk 1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:41:13 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<pre>- Read-only: the kiosk never marks emails read; unread always mirrors Outlook.
- Live status bar: connecting, fetching, Adam classifying n of m.
- Classification runs until the queue is empty.
- Emails moved or archived out of the inbox drop off the tiles.
- First sync loads 14 days (configurable); later syncs fetch only new mail.
- Self-update from this feed. No credentials in the APK; see SETUP.txt.</pre>]]></description>
